<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>DenseLands · Mapa da seed</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Source+Serif+4:wght@600;700&family=Source+Sans+3:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    :root {
      --ink: #1b1a17; --muted: #5c564c; --line: #c9bfa8; --paper: #f7f1e4;
      --card: #fffdf7; --link: #1b5c3a; --box: #efe6d2; --accent: #2f6b3a;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html, body { margin: 0; height: 100%; background: #e8dfc8; color: var(--ink); font: 15px/1.45 "Source Sans 3", sans-serif; }
    header {
      background: #1d2a1d; color: #f3ead4; border-bottom: 5px solid #6b4423;
      padding: 10px 16px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; align-items: center;
    }
    header h1 { margin: 0; font: 700 20px "Source Serif 4", serif; }
    header .brand { opacity: .7; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-right: 8px; }
    header input, header button, header select {
      font: 600 14px "Source Sans 3", sans-serif; padding: 7px 10px; border: 1px solid #6b4423; background: #fffdf7;
    }
    header button { background: #2f6b3a; color: #fff; border-color: #1d3d22; cursor: pointer; }
    header button.ghost { background: #efe6d2; color: #1b1a17; }
    .layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 280px 1fr; height: calc(100% - 54px); }
    aside {
      background: var(--card); border-right: 1px solid var(--line); overflow: auto; padding: 12px 14px 28px;
    }
    aside h2 { font: 700 15px "Source Serif 4", serif; margin: 16px 0 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
    aside h2:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
    .legend span { display: inline-block; width: 12px; height: 12px; margin-right: 6px; vertical-align: -1px; border: 1px solid #0003; }
    .mk { display: inline-block; width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; margin-right: 6px; vertical-align: -1px; }
    canvas { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; background: #0b1a22; cursor: grab; }
    canvas:active { cursor: grabbing; }
    .hud {
      position: absolute; left: 296px; bottom: 10px; background: rgba(255,253,247,.92);
      border: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 6px 10px; font-size: 13px; pointer-events: none;
    }
    .warn { border-left: 4px solid #8a4b16; background: #f7ecdc; padding: 8px 10px; margin: 8px 0; font-size: 13px; }
    .note { border-left: 4px solid var(--accent); background: #f3eee0; padding: 8px 10px; margin: 8px 0; font-size: 13px; }
    table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px; }
    th, td { border: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 4px 6px; text-align: left; }
    th { background: #efe6d2; }
    code { background: #efe6d2; padding: 0 4px; }
    @media (max-width: 800px) {
      .layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; grid-template-rows: 38vh 1fr; }
      aside { border-right: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
      .hud { left: 8px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div>
      <div class="brand">DenseLands</div>
      <h1>Mapa da seed</h1>
    </div>
    <label>Seed <input id="seed" value="942" size="14" /></label>
    <button type="button" id="go">Gerar</button>
    <select id="preset">
      <option value="">seeds prontas…</option>
      <option value="942">vila 942</option>
      <option value="5398">mina 5398</option>
      <option value="7437">navio 7437</option>
      <option value="2351">ilha 2351</option>
      <option value="7089">dungeon 7089</option>
      <option value="-926">praia -926</option>
      <option value="-5799">redonda -5799</option>
      <option value="-9521">dois navios -9521</option>
      <option value="-11087">dungeon spawn -11087</option>
      <option value="0">zero 0</option>
      <option value="4294967296">2³² 4294967296</option>
    </select>
    <button type="button" class="ghost" id="center">Ir ao spawn</button>
    <span id="eff" style="font-size:13px;opacity:.85"></span>
  </header>
  <div class="layout">
    <aside>
      <h2>Como usar</h2>
      <p>Mesmo gerador do jogo: altura, bioma e estruturas. Arraste o mapa, role para zoom, clique num ponto para ver o tile.</p>
      <p class="note">O spawn é o centro (0, 0). Marcadores são as estruturas que o mundo garante no começo + as que nasceriam nos chunks visíveis.</p>

      <h2>Legenda — chão</h2>
      <div class="legend">
        <div><span style="background:#2a6f9a"></span>Mar</div>
        <div><span style="background:#3d6b4a"></span>Pântano (água/grama)</div>
        <div><span style="background:#d2c07a"></span>Areia / praia</div>
        <div><span style="background:#6db36a"></span>Planície</div>
        <div><span style="background:#2f6b3a"></span>Floresta densa</div>
        <div><span style="background:#1d4a28"></span>Selva</div>
      </div>

      <h2>Legenda — marcas</h2>
      <div>
        <div><i class="mk" style="background:#c44536"></i>Spawn</div>
        <div><i class="mk" style="background:#e0b44b"></i>Vila</div>
        <div><i class="mk" style="background:#7a4ac8"></i>Casa de mago</div>
        <div><i class="mk" style="background:#222"></i>Masmorra</div>
        <div><i class="mk" style="background:#8d5a32"></i>Mina</div>
        <div><i class="mk" style="background:#6b4423"></i>Casa abandonada</div>
        <div><i class="mk" style="background:#888"></i>Navio</div>
        <div><i class="mk" style="background:#aaa"></i>Filão</div>
      </div>

      <h2>Ponto clicado</h2>
      <div id="info">Clique no mapa.</div>
      <h2>Estruturas desta seed</h2>
      <div id="list">Gere uma seed.</div>

      <h2>Onde a seed “buga”</h2>
      <p>O gerador não quebra de um frame para o outro. Ele <b>dobra números em 32 bits</b> e, bem longe, perde precisão. Os pontos são estes:</p>
      <table>
        <tr><th>Ponto</th><th>O que o jogo faz</th></tr>
        <tr><td>Seed <code>0</code></td><td><code>0 &gt;&gt;&gt; 0</code> vira 0, que é falso, então usa hash do texto "0" — não é o mundo zero.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Seed negativa</td><td><code>n &gt;&gt;&gt; 0</code> vira <code>n + 2³²</code>. −942 e 4294966354 são o mesmo mundo.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Seed ≥ 2³² (4 294 967 296)</td><td>O número dá a volta. 2³² vira 0 e cai no hash do texto. 2³²+1 vira seed 1.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Número com vírgula</td><td><code>1.9 &gt;&gt;&gt; 0</code> = 1. A parte decimal some.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Texto / Infinity</td><td>Se não for um número finito, vira FNV-1a do texto. "abc" e 12345 não se misturam.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Inteiro &gt; 2⁵³</td><td>O JavaScript nem guarda o número certo. Seeds vizinhas viram a mesma.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Tile |x| ou |y| ≥ 2³¹</td><td><code>x | 0</code> no hash da coordenada dá a volta. O mapa <b>repete</b> como um toro de 2 147 483 648 tiles.</td></tr>
      </table>
      <p class="warn"><b>Visível no mapa:</b> digite <code>0</code> e <code>4294967296</code> — o mundo efetivo não é “zero”, é o hash da string. Digite <code>-942</code> e <code>4294966354</code> — o desenho é idêntico. Longe demais (zoom mínimo e pan absurdo) as faixas de bioma começam a “quadricular” porque o ruído perde casas decimais.</p>
      <p><b>Por quê:</b> <code>hash2</code> faz <code>seed ^ imul(x|0) ^ imul(y|0)</code> e devolve um número 0–1. Operações <code>| 0</code> e <code>&gt;&gt;&gt; 0</code> no JS só enxergam 32 bits. O ruído <code>fbm</code> usa floats; quando a coordenada fica enorme, <code>tx * 0.042</code> não tem fração confiável e o fade do value-noise vira degrau.</p>
      <p>No jogo normal ninguém anda 2 bilhões de blocos. O “bug” que o jogador encontra de verdade é só o da <b>caixa de seed</b>: negativo, zero e número grande demais não são o que você digitou.</p>
    </aside>
    <div style="position:relative;min-height:240px">
      <canvas id="map"></canvas>
      <div class="hud" id="hud">—</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <script>
  (() => {
    const CHUNK = 16;
    function hashStr(s) {
      let h = 2166136261;
      const str = String(s);
      for (let i = 0; i < str.length; i++) {
        h ^= str.charCodeAt(i);
        h = Math.imul(h, 16777619);
      }
      return h >>> 0;
    }
    function seedFromInput(input) {
      if (!input || !String(input).trim()) return (Math.random() * 0xffffffff) >>> 0;
      const n = Number(input);
      if (Number.isFinite(n) && String(input).trim() !== "") return (n >>> 0) || hashStr(input);
      return hashStr(input);
    }
    function hash2(x, y, seed) {
      let h = seed ^ Math.imul(x | 0, 374761393) ^ Math.imul(y | 0, 668265263);
      h = Math.imul(h ^ (h >>> 13), 1274126177);
      return ((h ^ (h >>> 16)) >>> 0) / 4294967296;
    }
    function fade(t) { return t * t * (3 - 2 * t); }
    function valueNoise(x, y, seed) {
      const x0 = Math.floor(x), y0 = Math.floor(y);
      const fx = fade(x - x0), fy = fade(y - y0);
      const v00 = hash2(x0, y0, seed);
      const v10 = hash2(x0 + 1, y0, seed);
      const v01 = hash2(x0, y0 + 1, seed);
      const v11 = hash2(x0 + 1, y0 + 1, seed);
      const a = v00 + (v10 - v00) * fx;
      const b = v01 + (v11 - v01) * fx;
      return a + (b - a) * fy;
    }
    function fbm(x, y, seed) {
      let v = 0, a = 1, s = 0, f = 1;
      for (let i = 0; i < 5; i++) {
        v += valueNoise(x * f, y * f, seed + i * 1013) * a;
        s += a; a *= 0.5; f *= 2;
      }
      return v / s;
    }
    function heightAt(tx, ty, seed) {
      const n = fbm(tx * 0.042, ty * 0.042, seed);
      const n2 = fbm(tx * 0.018 + 40, ty * 0.018, seed + 7);
      return n * 0.62 + n2 * 0.38;
    }
    function isLandH(h) { return h >= 0.42; }
    function tileFromH(h) {
      if (h < 0.42) return "water";
      if (h < 0.47) return "sand";
      return "grass";
    }
    function biomeAt(tx, ty, seed) {
      const moist = fbm(tx * 0.011, ty * 0.011, seed + 41);
      const heat = fbm(tx * 0.008 + 28, ty * 0.008, seed + 77);
      if (!isLandH(heightAt(tx, ty, seed))) {
        if (moist > 0.56 && heat < 0.46) return "swamp";
        return "ocean";
      }
      if (moist > 0.56 && heat < 0.44) return "swamp";
      if (moist > 0.60 && heat > 0.46) return "jungle";
      if (moist > 0.52) return "forest";
      return "plains";
    }
    function biomeLabel(b) {
      return b === "jungle" ? "Selva" : b === "forest" ? "Floresta densa" : b === "swamp" ? "Pântano de slimes" : b === "ocean" ? "Mar" : "Planície";
    }
    function findLandNear(seed, cx, cy, maxR = 80) {
      if (isLandH(heightAt(cx, cy, seed))) return { x: cx, y: cy };
      for (let r = 1; r <= maxR; r++) {
        for (let dx = -r; dx <= r; dx++) {
          const spots = [
            { x: cx + dx, y: cy - r }, { x: cx + dx, y: cy + r },
            { x: cx - r, y: cy + dx }, { x: cx + r, y: cy + dx },
          ];
          for (const s of spots) if (isLandH(heightAt(s.x, s.y, seed))) return s;
        }
      }
      return { x: cx, y: cy };
    }
    function findDeepWaterNear(seed, cx, cy, maxR) {
      const deep = (x, y) => heightAt(x, y, seed) < 0.34;
      if (deep(cx, cy)) return { x: cx, y: cy };
      for (let r = 1; r <= maxR; r++) {
        for (let dx = -r; dx <= r; dx++) {
          const spots = [
            { x: cx + dx, y: cy - r }, { x: cx + dx, y: cy + r },
            { x: cx - r, y: cy + dx }, { x: cx + r, y: cy + dx },
          ];
          for (const s of spots) if (deep(s.x, s.y)) return s;
        }
      }
      return { x: cx, y: cy };
    }
    function placeLandmark(seed, salt, minD, maxD, water) {
      const ang = hash2(salt, 3, seed) * Math.PI * 2;
      const dist = minD + hash2(salt, 9, seed) * (maxD - minD);
      const tx = Math.round(Math.cos(ang) * dist);
      const ty = Math.round(Math.sin(ang) * dist);
      return water ? findDeepWaterNear(seed, tx, ty, 80) : findLandNear(seed, tx, ty, 50);
    }
    function findBiomeNear(seed, want, cx, cy, maxR) {
      for (let r = 0; r <= maxR; r++) {
        for (let dx = -r; dx <= r; dx++) {
          const spots = [
            { x: cx + dx, y: cy - r }, { x: cx + dx, y: cy + r },
            { x: cx - r, y: cy + dx }, { x: cx + r, y: cy + dx },
          ];
          for (const s of spots) {
            if (biomeAt(s.x, s.y, seed) === want && isLandH(heightAt(s.x, s.y, seed))) return s;
          }
        }
      }
      return findLandNear(seed, cx, cy, maxR);
    }

    const COLORS = {
      ocean: [28, 78, 122],
      swampW: [42, 78, 52],
      swamp: [58, 92, 48],
      sand: [210, 192, 122],
      plains: [109, 179, 106],
      forest: [47, 107, 58],
      jungle: [29, 74, 40],
    };
    function colorAt(tx, ty, seed) {
      const h = heightAt(tx, ty, seed);
      const b = biomeAt(tx, ty, seed);
      const tile = tileFromH(h);
      if (b === "ocean") return COLORS.ocean;
      if (b === "swamp") return tile === "water" ? COLORS.swampW : COLORS.swamp;
      if (tile === "sand") return COLORS.sand;
      if (b === "jungle") return COLORS.jungle;
      if (b === "forest") return COLORS.forest;
      return COLORS.plains;
    }

    let seed = seedFromInput("942");
    let raw = "942";
    const marks = [];
    const canvas = document.getElementById("map");
    const ctx = canvas.getContext("2d");
    let cam = { x: 0, y: 0, z: 3 }; // z = pixels per tile
    let drag = null;

    function considerChunk(cx, cy, acc) {
      const tx = cx * CHUNK + 8, ty = cy * CHUNK + 8;
      const bio = biomeAt(tx, ty, seed);
      if (bio === "ocean") return;
      const roll = hash2(cx, cy, seed + 301);
      if (roll < 0.905) return;
      const pos = findLandNear(seed, tx, ty, 10);
      const key = pos.x + "," + pos.y;
      if (acc.seen.has(key)) return;
      if (bio === "plains") {
        if (hash2(cx, 1, seed + 5) > 0.52) acc.push({ kind: "vila", x: pos.x, y: pos.y, extra: "chunk" });
        else acc.push({ kind: "mina", x: pos.x, y: pos.y, extra: "chunk" });
      } else if (bio === "forest") {
        if (hash2(cx, 2, seed + 6) > 0.48) acc.push({ kind: "masmorra", x: pos.x, y: pos.y, extra: "chunk" });
        else acc.push({ kind: "mago", x: pos.x, y: pos.y, extra: "chunk" });
      } else {
        const r = hash2(cx, 3, seed + 7);
        if (r > 0.64) acc.push({ kind: "masmorra", x: pos.x, y: pos.y, extra: "selva" });
        else if (r > 0.32) acc.push({ kind: "mina", x: pos.x, y: pos.y, extra: "rica" });
        else acc.push({ kind: "mago", x: pos.x, y: pos.y, extra: "chunk" });
      }
      acc.seen.add(key);
    }

    function rebuildMarks() {
      marks.length = 0;
      marks.push({ kind: "spawn", x: 0, y: 0, extra: "centro" });
      const shipA = placeLandmark(seed, 41, 70, 180, true);
      const shipB = placeLandmark(seed, 103, 90, 220, true);
      marks.push({ kind: "navio", x: shipA.x, y: shipA.y, extra: "A" });
      marks.push({ kind: "navio", x: shipB.x, y: shipB.y, extra: "B" });
      const house = findBiomeNear(seed, "plains", 20, -10, 90);
      marks.push({ kind: "casa", x: house.x, y: house.y, extra: "abandonada" });
      const vein = findLandNear(seed, -18, 22, 80);
      marks.push({ kind: "filao", x: vein.x, y: vein.y, extra: "" });
      const acc = { seen: new Set(), push(m) { marks.push(m); } };
      for (let cy = -8; cy <= 8; cy++) for (let cx = -8; cx <= 8; cx++) considerChunk(cx, cy, acc);
      if (!marks.some((m) => m.kind === "vila")) {
        const p = findBiomeNear(seed, "plains", 12, 8, 120);
        marks.push({ kind: "vila", x: p.x, y: p.y, extra: "garantida" });
      }
      if (!marks.some((m) => m.kind === "masmorra")) {
        const p = findBiomeNear(seed, "forest", -14, 16, 130);
        marks.push({ kind: "masmorra", x: p.x, y: p.y, extra: "garantida" });
      }
      if (!marks.some((m) => m.kind === "mina")) {
        const p = findBiomeNear(seed, "plains", 18, -20, 130);
        marks.push({ kind: "mina", x: p.x, y: p.y, extra: "garantida" });
      }
      if (!marks.some((m) => m.kind === "mago")) {
        const p = findBiomeNear(seed, "forest", -22, -8, 140);
        marks.push({ kind: "mago", x: p.x, y: p.y, extra: "garantida" });
      }
      const box = document.getElementById("list");
      box.innerHTML = marks.map((m) => {
        const d = Math.hypot(m.x, m.y) | 0;
        return "<div>" + m.kind + " · (" + m.x + "," + m.y + ") · " + d + " blocos" + (m.extra ? " · " + m.extra : "") + "</div>";
      }).join("");
    }

    function resize() {
      const dpr = Math.min(devicePixelRatio || 1, 2);
      const r = canvas.parentElement.getBoundingClientRect();
      canvas.width = Math.floor(r.width * dpr);
      canvas.height = Math.floor(r.height * dpr);
      canvas.style.width = r.width + "px";
      canvas.style.height = r.height + "px";
      ctx.setTransform(dpr, 0, 0, dpr, 0, 0);
      draw();
    }

    function draw() {
      const w = canvas.clientWidth, h = canvas.clientHeight;
      ctx.fillStyle = "#0b1a22";
      ctx.fillRect(0, 0, w, h);
      const z = cam.z;
      const step = z < 1.2 ? 4 : z < 2.2 ? 2 : 1;
      const x0 = Math.floor(cam.x - w / (2 * z));
      const y0 = Math.floor(cam.y - h / (2 * z));
      const x1 = Math.ceil(cam.x + w / (2 * z));
      const y1 = Math.ceil(cam.y + h / (2 * z));
      for (let ty = y0; ty < y1; ty += step) {
        for (let tx = x0; tx < x1; tx += step) {
          const c = colorAt(tx, ty, seed);
          ctx.fillStyle = "rgb(" + c[0] + "," + c[1] + "," + c[2] + ")";
          const sx = (tx - cam.x) * z + w / 2;
          const sy = (ty - cam.y) * z + h / 2;
          ctx.fillRect(sx, sy, Math.ceil(z * step) + 1, Math.ceil(z * step) + 1);
        }
      }
      const mkCol = {
        spawn: "#c44536", vila: "#e0b44b", mago: "#7a4ac8", masmorra: "#111",
        mina: "#8d5a32", casa: "#6b4423", navio: "#cfd6dc", filao: "#bbb",
      };
      marks.forEach((m) => {
        const sx = (m.x - cam.x) * z + w / 2;
        const sy = (m.y - cam.y) * z + h / 2;
        ctx.beginPath();
        ctx.fillStyle = mkCol[m.kind] || "#fff";
        ctx.arc(sx, sy, Math.max(3.5, z * 0.7), 0, Math.PI * 2);
        ctx.fill();
        ctx.strokeStyle = "#fff";
        ctx.lineWidth = 1;
        ctx.stroke();
        if (z >= 2.4) {
          ctx.fillStyle = "#fff";
          ctx.font = "11px Source Sans 3, sans-serif";
          ctx.fillText(m.kind, sx + 6, sy - 6);
        }
      });
      document.getElementById("hud").textContent =
        "seed efetiva " + seed + " · zoom " + z.toFixed(2) + " px/tile · centro (" + (cam.x|0) + "," + (cam.y|0) + ")";
    }

    function applySeed() {
      raw = document.getElementById("seed").value.trim();
      seed = seedFromInput(raw);
      const n = Number(raw);
      let note = "efetiva " + seed;
      if (Number.isFinite(n) && (n >>> 0) !== seed) note += " · (digitada não é a usada)";
      if (Number.isFinite(n) && n < 0) note += " · wrap 32 bits";
      document.getElementById("eff").textContent = note;
      rebuildMarks();
      draw();
    }

    canvas.addEventListener("pointerdown", (e) => {
      drag = { x: e.clientX, y: e.clientY, cx: cam.x, cy: cam.y, moved: false };
      canvas.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId);
    });
    canvas.addEventListener("pointermove", (e) => {
      if (!drag) return;
      const dx = e.clientX - drag.x, dy = e.clientY - drag.y;
      if (Math.hypot(dx, dy) > 3) drag.moved = true;
      cam.x = drag.cx - dx / cam.z;
      cam.y = drag.cy - dy / cam.z;
      draw();
    });
    canvas.addEventListener("pointerup", (e) => {
      if (drag && !drag.moved) {
        const r = canvas.getBoundingClientRect();
        const tx = Math.floor(cam.x + (e.clientX - r.left - r.width / 2) / cam.z);
        const ty = Math.floor(cam.y + (e.clientY - r.top - r.height / 2) / cam.z);
        const h = heightAt(tx, ty, seed);
        const b = biomeAt(tx, ty, seed);
        const tile = tileFromH(h);
        const near = marks.map((m) => ({ m, d: Math.hypot(m.x - tx, m.y - ty) })).sort((a, b) => a.d - b.d)[0];
        document.getElementById("info").innerHTML =
          "<b>(" + tx + ", " + ty + ")</b><br>bioma " + biomeLabel(b) +
          "<br>tile " + tile + " · altura " + h.toFixed(3) +
          "<br>chunk " + Math.floor(tx / CHUNK) + "," + Math.floor(ty / CHUNK) +
          (near && near.d < 8 ? "<br>perto: " + near.m.kind + " (" + near.d.toFixed(1) + ")" : "");
      }
      drag = null;
    });
    canvas.addEventListener("wheel", (e) => {
      e.preventDefault();
      const r = canvas.getBoundingClientRect();
      const mx = cam.x + (e.clientX - r.left - r.width / 2) / cam.z;
      const my = cam.y + (e.clientY - r.top - r.height / 2) / cam.z;
      const nz = Math.min(24, Math.max(0.15, cam.z * (e.deltaY > 0 ? 0.86 : 1.16)));
      cam.x = mx - (e.clientX - r.left - r.width / 2) / nz;
      cam.y = my - (e.clientY - r.top - r.height / 2) / nz;
      cam.z = nz;
      draw();
    }, { passive: false });

    document.getElementById("go").onclick = applySeed;
    document.getElementById("seed").addEventListener("keydown", (e) => { if (e.key === "Enter") applySeed(); });
    document.getElementById("preset").onchange = () => {
      const v = document.getElementById("preset").value;
      if (!v) return;
      document.getElementById("seed").value = v;
      applySeed();
    };
    document.getElementById("center").onclick = () => { cam.x = 0; cam.y = 0; cam.z = 3; draw(); };
    window.addEventListener("resize", resize);
    applySeed();
    resize();
  })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>
